---
---

<div class="section bordered">
  <div class="medium">
    <div class="narrow center section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow muted">When plans break</div>
      <div class="h2">What happens when today doesn't go to plan?</div>
      <div class="stack-lines">
        <div>You planned to train.</div>
        <div>But your knee hurts.</div>
        <div class="dim">A rigid plan doesn't know what to do.</div>
        <div class="punch">Personal-TrAIner does.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label accent-text">LOW ENERGY</div>
        <div class="card-body-lg">Your session can be reduced.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label accent-text">LIMITED BY PAIN</div>
        <div class="card-body-lg">Exercises that don't fit your current limitations are removed.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label accent-text">NOT ENOUGH TIME</div>
        <div class="card-body-lg">Your workout can adapt to the time you actually have.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="center punch-lg">Your plan adapts. You don't have to force it.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .section.bordered {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .medium {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-head {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .eyebrow.muted {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .h2 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .stack-lines {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .stack-lines .dim {
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.4);
  }

  .stack-lines .punch {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px 26px;
  }

  .card-label {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .accent-text {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .card-body-lg {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.7);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .punch-lg {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
